              "status": "pass",
              "recordId": "Rb.discovery.story.0"
            }
          },
          {
            "value": "Rubidium was discovered in 1861 by the German chemists Robert Bunsen and Gustav Kirchhoff while studying samples of the mineral lepidolite.",
